<http://data.opendiscoveryspace.eu/lom_ontology_ods.owl#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "An ontology and vocabulary used for exposing IEEE LOM, a metadata standard for educational contents, as Linked Data. \n\t\tIt is intended as a bridge for linkage of educational metadata into Linked Open Data (LOD). \n\t\tIn this ontology, we designed a mapping of IEEE LOM elements to RDF based on Linked Data principles. "@en .
